        <definition>std::pair&lt; Math::Tensors::FastorTensors::Tensor33d, Math::Tensors::FastorTensors::Tensor3333d &gt; Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Plasticity::FlowIntegration::FirstOrder::explicitIntegration</definition>
        <argsstring>(const Math::Tensors::FastorTensors::Tensor33d &amp;deltaGp)</argsstring>
        <name>explicitIntegration</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Plasticity::FlowIntegration::FirstOrder::explicitIntegration</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const Math::Tensors::FastorTensors::Tensor33d &amp;</type>
          <declname>deltaGp</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Computes the incremental plastic deformation gradient from the plastic velocity gradient using a first order approximation. The first order approximation is given by   <formula id="26">\[   \Delta F_{\bar I J} = \left( \delta_{\bar K L} + \Delta \lambda \frac{\partial f}{\partial M_{\bar K
L}}\right)_{J \bar{I}} \]</formula> where <formula id="27">$ \Delta \lambda \frac{\partial f}{\partial M_{\bar K L}} $</formula> is the incremental plastic velocity gradient.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>deltaGp</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Incremental plastic velocity gradient. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>A pair of the incremental plastic deformation gradient and its derivative w.r.t. the plastic velocity gradient. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
